// Seed-growth obligation for typed `gunbc run --arg` inhabitance in the seed CLI kernel.
// `gunbc.cli_dispatch_surface` owns the option as CliTextValue (argv is text). There is no
// `.dag` binder: `v2.cli.compile_cli` is the native compile door and has no `run` verb, so
// the seed CLI (`std.compiler_entry` RetainedHostCliKernel) is the only production route.
